1
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:29,561
Yeah, I'm gonna take a shower first.

2
00:00:32,040 --> 00:00:37,360
And did you even bring clothes to change into?
Here—see? I brought them.

3
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:44,079
Tawan… this time come help me look
for a new place to stay.

4
00:00:44,079 --> 00:00:50,879
What again, man? Every little thing and you wanna move out.
If you've got something going on with Gun, just tell me.

5
00:00:50,879 --> 00:00:56,719
This time I've made up my mind.
I'm not going back to live with someone that selfish again.

6
00:00:56,719 --> 00:01:03,440
Why? He's not good to you anymore?
Didn't you say he always buys you gifts?

7
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:08,480
How many big brothers would do that for you, huh?
Whatever he did that made you mad—just let it go.

8
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:13,560
He's still family.

9
00:01:15,280 --> 00:01:21,957
Damn, my legs are going numb already.
Sorry man, I'm going.

10
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:31,600
Who's that?
Hold on, I'll go check.

11
00:01:45,840 --> 00:01:48,430
I'm sorry.
Gun, calm down first.

12
00:01:48,430 --> 00:01:51,851
Come home with me.
Hey—let go of me! Calm down.

13
00:01:52,512 --> 00:01:57,464
And why aren't you wearing proper clothes?
I just finished showering.

14
00:01:57,464 --> 00:02:02,187
Don't tell me you and him—
